# sys-boat (docs/research/story-scenes.md): the Canalave–Iron Island boat both
# ways (play_boat_cutscene). From Canalave the ship by the player sails south (0.25 units a tick, 1.25 from its
# 24th update) with the camera following and panning east; 14 tiles out the two bridges play their one-shot
# clips; once both have ended and the ship is 25 tiles out the screen fades, the cinematic's length passes
# (its first animation's frames, then a 6-tick fade) and the map changes to Iron Island 100,502 facing east.
# The return starts at the fade and arrives at Canalave 44,750 facing west. A save round trip at idle before
# and after each trip.
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_CANALAVE_CITY 44 750 right
until idle
+0 screenshot boat-canalave
+0 reload
until idle
+0 press a
+1 release a
until menu 600
+4 press a
+1 release a
advance text 4000
until idle 600
+0 assert position platinum:MAP_HEADER_IRON_ISLAND 100 502
+0 assert state player.facing "right"
+0 screenshot boat-iron-island
+0 reload
until idle
+0 press left
+1 release left
until idle
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text 600
until yesno 600
+4 press a
+1 release a
advance text 4000
until idle 600
+0 assert position platinum:MAP_HEADER_CANALAVE_CITY 44 750
+0 assert state player.facing "left"
+0 reload
until idle
